course: dictionary
lesson: 15110
title: Sadden: to make someone feel sad
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Sadden is a verb, an action word. It means to make someone feel sad. «The bad news saddened the whole class.» The news did not stay in the room: it made the children feel sad. Find the person who feels it, and you have found the meaning.
explain: Grown-ups often use sadden in polite news: «We were saddened to hear that Grandpa is poorly.» It means we feel sad about it. It is a gentle way to share sorrow, often after a death or a disaster.
explain: Check the meaning by swapping in a simpler word: «The bad news made the whole class sad.» If it still makes sense, sadden means make sad. Notice the endings too: sadden, saddens, saddened and saddening all come from the same root.
fact: Sadden is a verb, so it is an action word.
fact: Its forms are sadden, saddens, saddened and saddening.
fact: «Sadden» means to make someone feel sad.
fact: Old use: «sadden» can also mean to become sad, as in «She saddened when the rain began.»
fact: Useful phrases: «deeply saddened», «saddened to hear», and «it saddens me».
exercise: «The news of the flood saddened everyone in the village.» What does saddened mean here? | *Made everyone feel sad | Made everyone sleepy | Made everyone laugh | Made everyone feel angry
exercise: «We were saddened to hear that Mrs Lee had moved away.» Why were people saddened? | *They felt sad about the news | They were very angry | They had won a prize | They were very hungry
exercise: Which word means the opposite of sadden? | Saddle | Darken | *Gladden | Madden
test: «Her kind words saddened the little boy.» What does this tell us? | The boy felt happy and bounced about | The boy fell fast asleep | *The boy felt sad after hearing them | The boy wanted a snack
test: Which phrase is a polite way to say people are very sad? | barely a whisper | cheerfully wrapped | *deeply saddened | wide awake
exam: «It saddens me that the park is closed today.» What does «it saddens me» mean? | It makes me feel hungry | It makes the park feel happy | It makes me feel sleepy | *It makes me feel sad
